      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Hi, I am thinking of doing a 76 pin 0.5x0.5 slot for run 3. To my understanding is that the project template ( https://mithro.github.io/gf180mcu-project-template/ ) isn't authoritative, in the event this doesn't match the expected power placement is there a list/discussion I can refer to for the power pin placement ?",
